  <Title type="string">On why the canvas must stay blank (ANLA access Restricted access)</Title>
  <synopsis type="string">The artist talks about how to hang a painting upside down on purpose. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</synopsis>
